:: START {"position":"1875,350","size":"100,100"}
🚀 JUNIOR ASTRONAUT MISSION: MARS

Welcome, Astronaut!

You are living at a base on Mars. Your job is to keep the crew, the food, the power, and the equipment safe.

⭐ Remember: in space, every choice has a cost and you must own the consequences, 
There is no perfect answer. You decide what to protect, and you live with what happens next.

[[Start my mission->Mars Map]]




:: Ship Air {"position":"4025,1150","size":"100,100"}



:: Ship Engine {"position":"3900,1150","size":"100,100"}



:: Ship Radio {"position":"3775,1150","size":"100,100"}



:: Solar Panels {"position":"1575,700","size":"100,100"}
SOLAR PANELS

Rows of flat panels face the Sun. They turn sunlight into the power the whole base runs on.

Mars is dusty, and the wind blows red dust onto the panels all the time.

(if: $storm_done is true)[
The panels are quiet now. The storm is over.
](else:)[
An alarm goes off at the control box. A solar storm is heading for the base.

[[Check the alert->Storm]]

[[Back to map->Mars Map]]
]


:: Spaceship {"position":"3000,700","size":"100,100"}
SPACESHIP

The ship that brought the crew to Mars. It landed at the edge of the base and hasn't moved since.

Inside there's a cockpit with screens and controls, a small cargo bay, and the seats the crew strapped into during the trip. Most of the equipment is turned off to save power.

(if: $habitat_done is true and $greenhouse_done is true and $storm_done is true and $garage_done is true and $expedition_done is true and $energy >= 1 and $food >= 1 and $health >= 1 and $time >= 1 and $data >= 1)[
The base is in order, and the ship has what it needs for the trip home.

[[Start the launch sequence->Launch Day]]
]
(else:)[
The ship can't launch yet.

(if: $habitat_done is not true or $greenhouse_done is not true or $storm_done is not true or $garage_done is not true or $expedition_done is not true)[Work still to do at the base:
(if: $habitat_done is not true)[- Habitat
]
(if: $greenhouse_done is not true)[- Greenhouse
]
(if: $storm_done is not true)[- Solar Panels
]
(if: $garage_done is not true)[- Rover Garage
]
(if: $expedition_done is not true)[- Investigation Crater
]
]

(if: $energy < 1 or $food < 1 or $health < 1 or $time < 1 or $data < 1)[The trip home needs at least 1 of everything, and you're missing:
(if: $energy < 1)[- Energy: the engines need power.
]
(if: $food < 1)[- Food: the crew has to eat on the way.
]
(if: $health < 1)[- Health: the crew isn't fit to travel.
]
(if: $time < 1)[- Time: the launch window is closing.
]
(if: $data < 1)[- Data: the scientists are waiting for the results from the crater.
]
]
]

[[Back to map->Mars Map]]


