:: Storm {"position":"1375,875","size":"100,100"}
STORM ALERT

A solar storm is coming. It could last a few hours or the whole night. Strong bursts from the Sun can damage electronics. If all the energy is turned off, the lights, the heat, and the radio will stop working.

[[Disconnect everything.->Disconnect All]]

[[Stay connected. L->Stay Connected]]

[[Disconnect only the science equipment. ->Disconnect Science]]


:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
tw-story {
  background: linear-gradient(#f7f0b8 0%, #f4cf8f 40%, #ea8f5f 100%);
  font-family: "Trebuchet MS", "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.25em;
  color: #3a1a10;
}

.mars-map {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 420px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: url('https://i.pinimg.com/1200x/23/35/b5/2335b5bbd1faf3df2a8eda7902d08a03.jpg') center/cover, linear-gradient(#c1440e, #7a2a08);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1000px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
}

selector {
  background-image: url("https://i.pinimg.com/1200x/23/35/b5/2335b5bbd1faf3df2a8eda7902d08a03.jpg");
}

/* contenedor general de cada zona */
.scene {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
}

/* bloque 1: imagen */
.scene-image {
  width: 100%;
  height: 260px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background-color: #7a2a08; /*Cambiar a background-image: url*/
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
}

/* la imagen de cada zona va en su propia clase */
.scene-image-crater {
  background-image: url('URL-DIRECTA-DE-LA-IMAGEN.jpg');
}

/* bloque 2: texto */
.scene-text {
  line-height: 1.5;
}

/* bloque 3: botones */
.scene-buttons {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
}

/* montañas verdes de fondo */
tw-story::before {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  height: 50vh;
  background: #84b8a3;
  clip-path: polygon(0 55%, 10% 35%, 22% 50%, 38% 18%, 52% 42%, 68% 22%, 82% 48%, 100% 30%, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* montañas rojas al frente */
tw-story::after {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  height: 30vh;
  background: #a8321c;
  clip-path: polygon(0 50%, 15% 20%, 30% 45%, 48% 10%, 62% 40%, 80% 15%, 100% 45%, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* tarjeta de texto, para que se lea bien sobre el paisaje */
tw-passage {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 20px auto;
  padding: 24px;
  background: rgba(255, 245, 228, 0.9);
  border-radius: 20px;
}

/* barra de medidores (passage con tag header) */
tw-include[type="header"] {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: block;
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 12px auto 0;
  padding: 10px 24px;
  background: rgba(255, 245, 228, 0.9);
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

/* enlaces como botones planos */
tw-link, .enchantment-link {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #e4572e;
  color: #ffffff;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  margin: 6px 0;
  border-radius: 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #9c2f12;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
}

tw-link:hover, .enchantment-link:hover {
  background: #ff7a4d;
}

/* ocultar flechas de retroceso */
tw-sidebar {
  display: none;
}